      "autoClaim:1": 0,
      "desc:8": "To carry a line between buildings, put up pylons: a Pylon Head on top of a pole of 6 to 16 Wood Frame Boxes, with a crossarm of 4 more right under the head.%n%nTaller is better. Two pylons link up to four times the shorter one's height apart, if nothing solid is in between. Put cable in your hotbar, then wrench one head and the other: that strings the span, one cable for every 4 blocks of it.%n%nPylons need no power and keep working in unloaded chunks. A run of Phone Cable reaches 128 blocks, terminal to terminal; past that it carries nothing.%n%nMore in the guide: [guide page=becom:wired.md]The wired network[/guide].",
